{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/publications/improvement-notice-issued-to-bury-metropolitan-borough-council-january-2022","content_id":"14583105-a9b3-4b19-95cc-55b58416b03d","description":"An improvement notice issued to Bury Metropolitan Borough Council following an Ofsted inspection in October 2021. ","details":{"attachments":[{"accessible":true,"alternative_format_contact_email":"alternative.formats@education.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"645a5e77479612000fc2927b","filename":"Bury_Improvement_Notice_January_2022_-_amended.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":134906,"filename":"Bury_Improvement_Notice_January_2022_-_amended.pdf","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9077338","isbn":"","number_of_pages":3,"title":"Improvement notice issued to Bury Metropolitan Borough Council (amended)","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/645a5e77479612000fc2927b/Bury_Improvement_Notice_January_2022_-_amended.pdf"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><div class=\"call-to-action\">\n  <p>This improvement notice was lifted on 31 December 2025, following a <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://reports.ofsted.gov.uk/provider/44/80443\">report by Ofsted</a> published on 29 July 2025.</p>\n</div>\n\n<p>The improvement notice required Bury Metropolitan Borough Council to take steps to improve its children’s social care services.</p>\n\n<p>It followed <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://reports.ofsted.gov.uk/provider/44/80443\">reports by Ofsted</a> that judged the overall effectiveness of children’s social care services provided by Bury Metropolitan Borough as inadequate.</p>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"This improvement notice was lifted on 31 December 2025.","public_timestamp":"2026-01-16T14:34:50Z"},{"note":"Improvement notice updated to reflect that the council has until December 2023 to improve.","